{"id":"125313f7bdb0c910","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Perfect Set Property","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property — ZFC Descriptive4 Perfect Set Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property — ZFC Descriptive4 Perfect Set Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-polish-space]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property — ZFC Descriptive4 Perfect Set Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space\">58-df-polish-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (set with the perfect set property)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span> (Polish-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space\">58-df-polish-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(|A|\\leq\\omega\\lor\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(P\\neq\\varnothing\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(|A|\\leq\\omega\\lor\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(P\\neq\\varnothing\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In a Polish space, a nonempty perfect subset has cardinality continuum; that cardinal consequence is downstream.</li>\n<li>Perfectness is expressed in the ambient topology as closedness plus absence of isolated points, avoiding the incompatible fixed-metric predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polish-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polish}_S$ (Polish-space predicate, see [[58-df-polish-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(|A|\\leq\\omega\\lor\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(P\\neq\\varnothing\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1499,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9ef09a86db92f05","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S$ (perfect-set-property predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1843","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4b3a8629f6a6f868","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}